<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; (this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i)) || (\old(this.get(i)) == null && this.get(i) == null));</code>
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i)) || (\old(this.get(i)) == null &amp;&amp; this.get(i) == null);</code>

This assertion ensures that for every index `i` from `0` to `index-1`, the element at `i` either remains unchanged or continues to be `null` if it was `null` before the insertion.
--------------------
<code>assert \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; this.get(i) == \old(this.get(i)) || (\old(this.get(i)) == null && this.get(i) == null);</code>
